      "questionName": "Question 7:",
      "questionType": "MultipleChoice",
      "questionText": "<p><em><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Choose the underlined part that needs correction.</span></em></p>\n<p><strong><u>Last summer</u> I <u>have stayed</u> <u>on</u> my aunt's farm <u>for</u> a month.</strong></p>",
